00:29:07.539 --> 00:29:13.960
because it was off in sunny in Los Angeles as it is, but it's not off in sunny when it rains.
因为洛杉矶通常都很晴朗，但下雨的时候可不常晴朗。

00:29:13.960 --> 00:29:27.839
