But there was, it's true what you say, like there was something like during those big rain scenes on the Fox lot New York street that I would always have a pinch myself moment where I'd be like, I've really made it in show business.
但正如你所说的那样，在福克斯片场纽约街的那些大型雨景拍摄期间，我总会有种掐自己一下的时刻，心想，我真正在演艺界闯出名堂了。

00:30:44.200 --> 00:30:45.039
Yeah, yeah.
对，对。

