But I did, you know, sometimes there are certain things that you have to do as an actor that require an enormous amount of imagination because you're not actually experiencing the conditions.
但我确实觉得，你知道的，有时作为演员，有些事情你需要付出极大的想象力，因为你并没有真正经历那种环境。

00:31:08.960 --> 00:31:15.880
But there's something about getting rained on that is so real and visceral and tactile that it puts you in the scene in a different way.
但淋雨有种极其真实、有血有肉且触手可及的感觉，它能以一种完全不同的方式把你拉进那个场景里。

