We meet Ted in the pilot and he's like, I'm the single guy and there's this couple.
我们在试播集中遇到了泰德，他就像是，我是单身汉，而那边是一对情侣。

00:33:16.128 --> 00:33:22.406
Season two is Marshall's the single guy and Ted and Robin are this couple and now Barney has also lost his wingman.
而到了第二季，马修成了单身汉，泰德和罗宾成了一对，现在巴尼也失去了他的僚机。

00:33:22.406 --> 00:33:25.846
So like all of those new conditions in season two were so rich.
所以，第二季中所有这些全新的状态都太丰富了。

00:33:25.846 --> 00:33:34.362
I felt like we really did an interesting shuffling of the deck of cards in the beginning of season two and I'm loving season two because it really paid off.
我觉得我们在第二季刚开始时，真的做了一次非常有趣的洗牌，而且我很喜欢第二季，因为这真的收到了回报。

00:33:34.362 --> 00:33:35.782
It was a lot of big moves.
那有很多大手笔的调整。

00:33:35.782 --> 00:33:41.569
The network wasn't completely convinced of how many big moves were ending season one on, to put it mildly.
说得委婉一点，电视网当时并不完全确信第一季结尾时那些大手笔的调整会有什么效果。

00:33:41.569 --> 00:33:52.651
And I guess I'm feeling a little vindicated when I watch season two, I'm going, no, we needed to make all those big moves to give ourselves fuel for new stories and to see new speeds of these characters.
我想当我观看第二季时，我感到有些平反的感觉，我心想，不，我们需要做出所有这些重大的调整，来为新故事提供燃料，并看到这些角色展现出新的状态。

00:33:52.651 --> 00:33:59.039
And the same's gonna be true with the end of season two heading into season three, the condition really shifts again.
从第二季末尾过渡到第三季时也是如此，角色的处境再次发生了巨大转变。

00:33:59.039 --> 00:34:01.059
And I just think you have to do that.
我只是觉得你必须这样做。

00:34:01.059 --> 00:34:04.990
