正是这种做法让你能够深入了解这些角色。

00:34:04.990 --> 00:34:06.486
you've got to mix it up, right?
你得有所变通，对吧？

00:34:06.486 --> 00:34:07.500
You've got to evolve.
你必须不断演变。

00:34:07.500 --> 00:34:11.846
We're saying this about Mr. Vanderbeek earlier, like you've got to find new speeds, right?
我们之前谈到范德比克先生时也这么说过，你必须找到新的状态，对吧？

00:34:11.846 --> 00:34:19.619
That's like, if you're an artist, like you've got to try to challenge yourself, you've got to paint yourself into some new corners and see how you get out of it.
这就好比，如果你是一个艺术家，你必须尝试挑战自我，你必须把自己逼到某些全新的死胡同里，然后看看自己是怎么脱身的。

00:34:19.619 --> 00:34:22.275
And that's what I'm getting out of watching season two.
这就是我从重温第二季中体会到的。

00:34:22.275 --> 00:34:28.020
I'm realizing like we really, we changed the genetic makeup of the show without losing what was special about the show.
我意识到，我们真的改变了节目的基因构成，同时又没有失去这个节目最特别的地方。

00:34:28.020 --> 00:34:31.931
But yeah, Ted and Robin are the couple and Marshall's the single guy for a while.
