00:34:31.931 --> 00:34:33.670
And that was really fun on the ride.
这段经历真的非常有趣。

00:34:33.670 --> 00:34:44.510
Yeah, you know, one thing that I have been struck by for both seasons as we've been watching, I remember Bruce who was, I think, C-camera or B-camera operator for the whole time.
对，你知道的，在我们重温的过程中，有一件事让我对这两季都印象深刻，我记得布鲁斯——我想他整个过程都是C组摄像师或B组摄像师。

00:34:44.510 --> 00:35:08.469
Yeah, Bruce said to me, because he'd been on a lot of long running shows, he said, maybe after like halfway through season one, he said, you're gonna look back on these episodes and they're gonna seem like, oh, wow, we were really young or really hadn't, you know, not to say that we, like he thought they were great, It was just he had been on enough shows to know that you'll look back and realize, like, oh, we were still finding it.
是的，布鲁斯对我说过，因为他参与过很多长期播出的剧集，他在第一季大概过半的时候说，你们回看这些剧集时，会觉得，哦，天哪，我们当时真的很年轻，或者说还没完全，你知道的，倒不是说他觉得不好，只是他参与过足够多的剧集，所以知道你会回过头来意识到，哦，我们当时还在摸索中。

00:35:08.469 --> 00:35:14.510
I think there's some truth to that, but mostly what I've been delighted by is we came out of the gate really strong.
