00:43:44.500 --> 00:43:46.019
It was a great scene between the two of them.
这是他们两人之间非常精彩的一场戏。

00:43:46.019 --> 00:43:51.659
Barney dropped some real wisdom in that scene and it kind of affects the outcome of the episode.
巴尼在那场戏里抛出了一些真正的智慧，它在某种程度上影响了这一集的结局。

00:43:51.659 --> 00:43:52.500
It was an important scene.
那是一场重要的戏。

00:43:52.500 --> 00:43:55.219
And she said, let's bother with the fourth wall on this one.
她说，这一集我们就在第四堵墙上费点心吧。

00:43:55.219 --> 00:43:59.579
Let's put them somewhere different and the scene will pop a little more because it's an important scene.
把他们放在不同的地方，这个场景会更出彩，因为它是一场重要的戏。

00:43:59.579 --> 00:44:00.699
Yeah.
是的。

00:44:00.699 --> 00:44:08.380
And okay, so a great last question here and we can wrap it up today.
好吧，最后一个好问题，我们今天就可以结束了。

