This is from b.jordan.garcea.
这是来自 b.jordan.garcea 的提问。

00:44:12.019 --> 00:44:21.579
It says, a question, if you could boil the series down into one central question that was explored, what would it be and what was the impulse to explore that?
上面写着，一个问题，如果你能把这部剧浓缩为一个探讨的核心问题，那会是什么，而探索这个问题的冲动是什么？

00:44:21.579 --> 00:44:28.139
And maybe we could even, you could talk about the whole series or maybe just the first couple of seasons because that's kind of what we're up to.
也许我们甚至可以，你可以谈谈整部剧，或者仅仅谈谈前几季，因为这正是我们目前所在的进度。

00:44:28.139 --> 00:44:33.460
I think it's, for me, it's our foxes trying to seduce humans into domesticating.
我觉得，对我来说，这是我们的狐狸试图诱惑人类将它们驯化。

00:44:33.460 --> 00:44:35.619
That's really what I was training about.
这确实是我一直在训练的内容。

00:44:35.619 --> 00:44:37.360
That's what this IG Live has been about.
这就是本次 IG 直播的主题。

00:44:37.360 --> 00:44:39.260
What this series about.
这也是本剧的主题。

00:44:39.260 --> 00:44:42.260
Okay, the series, okay, I thought there's just this hour.
好吧，这部剧，好吧，我还以为这只针对这一个小时。

00:44:43.980 --> 00:44:52.179
The series is about so many things, but I guess just to bring it back to Mr. Vanderbeek, I would say evolution.
这部剧关乎很多事情，但我想回到范德比克（Vanderbeek）先生的话题，我会说演变。

00:44:53.260 --> 00:45:00.690
This shows about personal evolution and the letting go of your frozen idea.
这部剧讲述的是个人演变，以及放下你那僵化的观念。

00:45:01.050 --> 00:45:03.650
Like you use the word frozen, Josh, don't get frozen.
就像你用了“僵化”这个词，乔什，不要僵化。

00:45:03.690 --> 00:45:21.690
Your idea of what it's all going to be like, instead embracing the chaos and embracing the change and embracing it, it's not all going to go according to plan, but knowing that what gets you through all of the bumps and turbulence of that is love.
你对这一切会怎样的设想，而是去拥抱混乱，拥抱变化，拥抱它，事情不会完全按计划进行，但要知道，带你度过所有坎坷和波折的是爱。

00:45:22.469 --> 00:45:28.550
Yeah, I would just add also learning to trust that the universe's plan is better than mine.
是的，我还要补充一点：学会相信宇宙的计划比我的更好。

00:45:29.460 --> 00:45:30.096
Yes, yes.
对，对。

00:45:30.096 --> 00:45:32.853
Deeper and more complicated and better.
更深刻、更复杂、也更好。

00:45:32.853 --> 00:45:37.378
It's just, yeah, that's what's being embraced in that evolution.
就是这样，是的，这就是那种演变中所拥抱的东西。

00:45:37.378 --> 00:45:38.156
I think so.
我想是的。

